ShinColle-kai Yukikaze model and presentation

Artwork and model by ズィズィ
Copyright (c) 2026 ズィズィ

This license covers the Yukikaze geometry (geo/yukikaze.geo.json), animation
(animations/yukikaze.animation.json), texture (textures/entity/yukikaze.png and
yukikaze.png.mcmeta), Blockbench source (model_sources/yukikaze/yukikaze.bbmodel),
visual (shincolle_kai/visuals/yukikaze.json), ship definition
(data/shincolle_kai/shincolle_kai/ships/yukikaze.json), and Java files in
com/lulan/shincolle/client/visual/yukikaze/.

Credit: "Yukikaze model by ズィズィ"

